<style id="v947toss">/* v947, Toss-style pass 62. My loan: the amount left is the hero (44px) over a thicker bar, the details are flat 56px lines, the schedule is a timeline (a dot per payment, the next one in the brand colour, "Next" as a pill) and the list now scrolls clear of the two buttons. */
