</style>
<style id="v948toss">/* v948, Toss-style pass 63. Paid instalments get a green tick dot and a muted date. Confirm sheets (pay instalment, repay in full and every other one-button sheet) read as a short list instead of a paragraph and get a quiet "Not now". */
