<style id="v954toss">/* v954, Toss-style pass 69. Eats tracking: the arrival time is the hero (36px), the line under it is plain 15px grey, the map is a calmer 20px-radius tile with no extra frame, and the rider buttons are 52px rounded actions, with the main one (Message rider, Rate your order) filled in the brand colour. */
